Package: pier-agent
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd, passwd, libc-bin, bash
Description: Pier deployment agent and application supervisor
 Receives encrypted deployments from pier-controller and supervises applications
 under individual system accounts. Run sudo pier-agent init after installation.
